#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "JSON-RPC endpoints"
msgstr "OpenEMS-Entwicklung: JSON-RPC-Endpunkte"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:9
msgid ""
"__As of: 2026-11-01 · OpenEMS version 2026.11.0-SNAPSHOT (development "
"version, branch develop)__"
msgstr ""
"__Stand: 01.11.2026 · OpenEMS-Version 2026.11.0-SNAPSHOT (Entwicklungsstand, "
"Branch develop)__"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The UI, Backend and external programs communicate with the Edge via JSON-RPC "
"(Websocket, REST `+/jsonrpc+`, forwarded via the Backend). The protocol is "
"described in xref:component-communication/index.adoc[Component "
"Communication]. A component can offer its own methods, e.g. the Controller "
"for time-of-use tariffs offers the method `+getSchedule+`. How to call such "
"requests from outside is described on the user page xref:user/external-"
"interfaces/json-rpc.adoc[JSON-RPC]."
msgstr ""
"Oberfläche, Backend und externe Programme sprechen mit der Edge über JSON-"
"RPC (Websocket, REST `+/jsonrpc+`, über das Backend weitergeleitet). Das "
"Protokoll beschreibt xref:latest@component-communication/"
"index.adoc[Component Communication]. Eine Komponente kann eigene Methoden "
"anbieten, z. B. der Controller für dynamische Stromtarife die Methode "
"`+getSchedule+`. Wie man solche Requests von außen aufruft, beschreibt die "
"Anwenderseite xref:user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc[JSON-RPC]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Route of a request"
msgstr "Weg eines Requests"

#. type: #sec-route-of-a-request
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Methods of a component are not called directly, but wrapped in "
"`+componentJsonApi+`:"
msgstr ""
"Methoden einer Komponente werden nicht direkt aufgerufen, sondern in "
"`+componentJsonApi+` verpackt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": \"UUID\", \"method\": \"componentJsonApi\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"componentId\": \"ctrlEssTimeOfUseTariff0\",\n"
"    \"payload\": {\n"
"      \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": \"UUID\", \"method\": \"getSchedule\", \"params\": {}\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": \"UUID\", \"method\": \"componentJsonApi\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"componentId\": \"ctrlEssTimeOfUseTariff0\",\n"
"    \"payload\": {\n"
"      \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": \"UUID\", \"method\": \"getSchedule\", \"params\": {}\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The `+ComponentRequestHandler+` (`+io.openems.edge.controller.api.common+`) "
"binds **all** components that offer the interface `+ComponentJsonApi+` via "
"OSGi reference (dynamic, any number). It looks for the component via "
"`+componentId+` and passes `+payload+` on to its routes. If the ID is "
"unknown, “Component with id '…' was not found” is returned."
msgstr ""
"Der `+ComponentRequestHandler+` (`+io.openems.edge.controller.api.common+`) "
"bindet per OSGi-Referenz **alle** Komponenten, die das Interface "
"`+ComponentJsonApi+` anbieten (dynamisch, beliebig viele). Er sucht die "
"Komponente über `+componentId+` und reicht `+payload+` an deren Routen "
"weiter. Ist die ID unbekannt, kommt „Component with id '…' was not found“ "
"zurück."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Offering an endpoint"
msgstr "Endpunkt anbieten"

#. type: #sec-offering-an-endpoint
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The component implements `+ComponentJsonApi+` and names the interface in the "
"`+implements+` list (otherwise it is not found as a service)."
msgstr ""
"Die Komponente implementiert `+ComponentJsonApi+` und nennt das Interface in "
"der `+implements+`-Liste (sonst wird sie nicht als Dienst gefunden)."

#. type: #sec-offering-an-endpoint
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:37
msgid ""
"It overrides `+buildJsonApiRoutes(JsonApiBuilder builder)+` and registers "
"its methods there."
msgstr ""
"Sie überschreibt `+buildJsonApiRoutes(JsonApiBuilder builder)+` und "
"registriert dort ihre Methoden."

#. type: #sec-offering-an-endpoint
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:39
msgid "Simple form (from `+TimeOfUseTariffControllerImpl+`):"
msgstr "Einfache Form (aus `+TimeOfUseTariffControllerImpl+`):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"public void buildJsonApiRoutes(JsonApiBuilder builder) {\n"
"    builder.handleRequest(GetScheduleRequest.METHOD, call -> {\n"
"        return GetScheduleResponse.from(call.getRequest().getId(), this.id(),\n"
"                this.componentManager.getClock(), this.ess, this.timedata, this.energyScheduleHandler);\n"
"    });\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"@Override\n"
"public void buildJsonApiRoutes(JsonApiBuilder builder) {\n"
"    builder.handleRequest(GetScheduleRequest.METHOD, call -> {\n"
"        return GetScheduleResponse.from(call.getRequest().getId(), this.id(),\n"
"                this.componentManager.getClock(), this.ess, this.timedata, this.energyScheduleHandler);\n"
"    });\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Here the handler works with the raw `+JsonrpcRequest+`; the request class "
"has a constant `+METHOD+` and a method `+from(JsonrpcRequest)+` that reads "
"the parameters."
msgstr ""
"Hier arbeitet der Handler mit dem rohen `+JsonrpcRequest+`; die Request-"
"Klasse hat eine Konstante `+METHOD+` und eine Methode `+from(JsonrpcRequest)"
"+`, die die Parameter ausliest."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Typed form"
msgstr "Typisierte Form"

#. type: #sec-typed-form
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Newer endpoints describe request and response as a type "
"(`+EndpointRequestType+`) with serializers. Example "
"`+DisconnectOAuthConnection+`:"
msgstr ""
"Neuere Endpunkte beschreiben Request und Response als Typ "
"(`+EndpointRequestType+`) mit Serialisierern. Beispiel "
"`+DisconnectOAuthConnection+`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class DisconnectOAuthConnection\n"
"        implements EndpointRequestType<DisconnectOAuthConnection.Request, EmptyObject> {\n"
msgstr ""
"public class DisconnectOAuthConnection\n"
"        implements EndpointRequestType<DisconnectOAuthConnection.Request, EmptyObject> {\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    public String getMethod() { return \"disconnectOAuthConnection\"; }\n"
"    public JsonSerializer<Request> getRequestSerializer() { return Request.serializer(); }\n"
"    public JsonSerializer<EmptyObject> getResponseSerializer() { return EmptyObject.serializer(); }\n"
msgstr ""
"    public String getMethod() { return \"disconnectOAuthConnection\"; }\n"
"    public JsonSerializer<Request> getRequestSerializer() { return Request.serializer(); }\n"
"    public JsonSerializer<EmptyObject> getResponseSerializer() { return EmptyObject.serializer(); }\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    public record Request(String identifier) {\n"
"        public static JsonSerializer<Request> serializer() {\n"
"            return jsonObjectSerializer(Request.class,\n"
"                    json -> new Request(json.getString(\"identifier\")),\n"
"                    obj -> JsonUtils.buildJsonObject().addProperty(\"identifier\", obj.identifier()).build());\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"    public record Request(String identifier) {\n"
"        public static JsonSerializer<Request> serializer() {\n"
"            return jsonObjectSerializer(Request.class,\n"
"                    json -> new Request(json.getString(\"identifier\")),\n"
"                    obj -> JsonUtils.buildJsonObject().addProperty(\"identifier\", obj.identifier()).build());\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:78
msgid "Registration with description and role check:"
msgstr "Registrierung mit Beschreibung und Rollenprüfung:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"builder.handleRequest(new DisconnectOAuthConnection(),\n"
"        endpoint -> endpoint.setDescription(\"Disconnects an OAuth connection.\")\n"
"                .setGuards(EdgeGuards.roleIsAtleast(Role.OWNER)),\n"
"        call -> {\n"
"            var request = call.getRequest();       // already as a record\n"
"            ...\n"
"            return EmptyObject.INSTANCE;\n"
"        });\n"
msgstr ""
"builder.handleRequest(new DisconnectOAuthConnection(),\n"
"        endpoint -> endpoint.setDescription(\"Disconnects an OAuth connection.\")\n"
"                .setGuards(EdgeGuards.roleIsAtleast(Role.OWNER)),\n"
"        call -> {\n"
"            var request = call.getRequest();       // bereits als Record\n"
"            ...\n"
"            return EmptyObject.INSTANCE;\n"
"        });\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:92
msgid ""
"(The registration is an example; the role required by the original endpoint "
"is in its component.)"
msgstr ""
"(Die Registrierung ist ein Beispiel; welche Rolle der Original-Endpunkt "
"verlangt, steht in dessen Komponente.)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Advantage: reading the parameters is in one place, the handler receives "
"finished objects, and the description appears in the endpoint overview."
msgstr ""
"Vorteil: Das Lesen der Parameter steht an einer Stelle, der Handler bekommt "
"fertige Objekte, und die Beschreibung erscheint in der Endpunkt-Übersicht."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roles and guards"
msgstr "Rollen und Guards"

#. type: #sec-roles-and-guards
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:99
msgid ""
"An endpoint only checks roles if it sets **guards**. "
"`+EndpointDefinitionBuilder+` starts with an empty guard list, and "
"`+componentJsonApi+` itself does not set any."
msgstr ""
"Ein Endpunkt prüft Rollen nur, wenn er **Guards** setzt. "
"`+EndpointDefinitionBuilder+` startet mit einer leeren Guard-Liste, und "
"`+componentJsonApi+` selbst setzt keine."

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Guard (`+EdgeGuards+`)\n"
"| Effect\n"
"\n"
"| `+roleIsAtleast(role)+`\n"
"| User needs at least this role.\n"
"| `+roleIsAtleastFromBackend(role)+`\n"
"| only for requests coming via the Backend: at least this role\n"
"| `+roleIsAtleastNotFromBackend(role)+`\n"
"| only for local requests: at least this role\n"
msgstr ""
"| Guard (`+EdgeGuards+`)\n"
"| Wirkung\n"
"\n"
"| `+roleIsAtleast(role)+`\n"
"| Benutzer braucht mindestens diese Rolle.\n"
"| `+roleIsAtleastFromBackend(role)+`\n"
"| nur für Requests, die über das Backend kommen: mindestens diese Rolle\n"
"| `+roleIsAtleastNotFromBackend(role)+`\n"
"| nur für lokale Requests: mindestens diese Rolle\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:114
msgid ""
"Roles from low to high: GUEST, OWNER, INSTALLER, ADMIN. Example from the "
"`+ComponentManager+`: `+getEdgeConfig+` requires GUEST; "
"`+createComponentConfig+` requires INSTALLER via the Backend, ADMIN locally "
"(both guards set at the same time)."
msgstr ""
"Rollen von niedrig nach hoch: GUEST, OWNER, INSTALLER, ADMIN. Beispiel aus "
"dem `+ComponentManager+`: `+getEdgeConfig+` verlangt GUEST; "
"`+createComponentConfig+` verlangt über das Backend INSTALLER, lokal ADMIN "
"(beide Guards gleichzeitig gesetzt)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:116
msgid ""
"**Recommendation:** Every endpoint sets a guard, at least "
"`+roleIsAtleast(Role.GUEST)+`; endpoints that change something or provide "
"confidential data accordingly higher."
msgstr ""
"**Empfehlung:** Jeder Endpunkt setzt einen Guard, mindestens "
"`+roleIsAtleast(Role.GUEST)+`; Endpunkte, die etwas ändern oder vertrauliche "
"Daten liefern, entsprechend höher."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other building blocks"
msgstr "Weitere Bausteine"

#. type: #sec-other-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:121
msgid ""
"`+call.get(EdgeKeys.USER_KEY)+` returns the logged-in user, e.g. for logging "
"or your own checks."
msgstr ""
"`+call.get(EdgeKeys.USER_KEY)+` liefert den angemeldeten Benutzer, z. B. für "
"Protokollierung oder eigene Prüfungen."

#. type: #sec-other-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:122
msgid ""
"`+builder.delegate(…)+` forwards sub-requests to another builder; "
"`+componentJsonApi+` itself is built this way."
msgstr ""
"`+builder.delegate(…)+` leitet Unter-Requests an einen anderen Builder "
"weiter; so ist `+componentJsonApi+` selbst gebaut."

#. type: #sec-other-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Errors are reported as an exception (`+OpenemsNamedException+`, "
"`+OpenemsException+`); it becomes the JSON-RPC error response."
msgstr ""
"Fehler meldet man als Ausnahme (`+OpenemsNamedException+`, "
"`+OpenemsException+`); sie wird zur JSON-RPC-Fehlerantwort."

#. type: #sec-other-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/json-rpc-endpoints.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Requests with a long runtime block the caller until the response. It is "
"better to prepare or cache computationally intensive work."
msgstr ""
"Requests mit langer Laufzeit blockieren den Aufrufer bis zur Antwort. "
"Rechenintensives besser vorbereiten oder zwischenspeichern."
